- `services/account/src/datafn/search-provider.ts:79` — rejects every non-HTTPS endpoint.
- `services/account/.env.example:11` — enables a loopback HTTP OpenSearch endpoint by default.

## Required outcome
- Remote OpenSearch endpoints remain restricted to HTTPS.
- A developer using the repository's documented local environment can initialize DataFn without an immediate configuration error.
