          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Derive the DataFn region from the deployment configuration**\n\nWhen callers provide explicit `deployment.regions` without setting the process-wide `ACCOUNT_REGION_ID`, every service instance is labeled `local`; `createMultiRegionAccountHarness` demonstrates this by constructing distinct `us` and `eu` instances while leaving the environment unset. This value is passed to the DataFn multi-region plugin, directory records, and `x-datafn-region`, so programmatically composed regions collapse to the same identity. Fall back to the active deployment region rather than `local` when regions were supplied."
