          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Bind the DataFn directory to one shared worker**\n\nWhen data is shared or routed between different account regions, this binding gives every regional worker its own Durable Object namespace because it omits `script_name`; the deploy loop creates a separate worker script for each region. `createSyncServer` then supplies that isolated directory to `datafnMultiRegionPlugin`, so records written in one region cannot be resolved from another. Host `ACCOUNT_RUNTIME_STORES` in a common worker and bind every regional worker to it, as is already done for `AUTHFN_REGION_LOOKUP`."
