          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Include the deployment environment in the search index prefix**\n\nWhen dev, pre, and live use the same OpenSearch cluster without explicitly setting `DATAFN_OPENSEARCH_INDEX_PREFIX`, they all derive the same `nucleum_production_<region>` prefix because `scripts/wrangler-config.mjs` sets `NODE_ENV` to `production` for every regional Worker. This can mix search documents and results across environments; derive the prefix from the account deployment environment or emit a distinct prefix in each generated Worker configuration."
