          "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/569#discussion_r3888887136",
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Bind OpenSearch settings in Worker deployments**\n\nFor Workers deployed solely through the checked-in account workflow, `DATAFN_OPENSEARCH_URL` is never present: `wrangler-config.mjs` emits only `DATAFN_OPENSEARCH_INDEX_PREFIX`, and `config/environments.json` defines no Secrets Store bindings for the URL or credentials. This branch consequently returns `undefined` in every fresh Cloudflare deployment, disabling the new server-side search provider and its mutation indexing even though the memory harness always injects a provider; provision the URL and authentication through the generated Worker configuration.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L18-L19](https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/blob/d2988ed92c0b6c27e1912f17fb41e2213a9e19eb/AGENTS.md#L18-L19)"
