          "body": "_📐 Maintainability & Code Quality_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**Move `AccountWorkerEnv` to a shared type module.**\n\n`AccountWorkerEnv` is now a cross-module contract. `services/account/src/runtime-stores.ts` and `services/account/src/db/sync-cloudflare.ts` consume it. Keep this type in `shared/types` or `client/types`, then import it from each runtime module.\n\nAs per coding guidelines, “Keep shared types in `shared/types` or `client/types`, aligning serialization logic with these definitions before modifying APIs.”"
