          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Resolve client IPs in the Node runtime**\n\nWhen the checked Node entrypoint is used, its `deployment` supplies only observability, leaving this resolver undefined; AuthFn 0.2 then assigns every request the IP key `unknown`. Consequently unrelated clients share one persisted rate-limit counter and aggregate traffic can exhaust limits such as 20 OTP sends per five minutes, after which all users are rejected until the window resets. Preserve the prior trusted proxy-header resolution for the Node deployment rather than configuring an undefined resolver."
